Z||000001||TRiAD||12-15-2001||01:03 PM||||Tommy Kaira. It's a ZZ2, second generation. They just came out. <P>Mid engine, AWD, Skyline power (TT i-6) and 6sp manual. <P>Built in England (down the road from Lotus) sold <B>exclusively</B> in Japan. <P>VERY nice, and only about $150KUS, but you can't get them here. <BR><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://communities.msn.com/_Secure/0NgAAAMsSN*Wryq60N*CeWB!hXjfeIaMEc1YxPH9aPzaIXm!17ZpdBFE0Yk*d*dHNFG*GR3SFyLa8KJgh1IKe2Q/xmas-sig.jpg">       <BR><B><I><FONT COLOR="red">Merry Christmas!</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="blue">Project MR1 ~ triadtuning@hotmail.com</B><BR>Photoshop rendition of planned modifications<BR>AIM ~ Michael Blue 72</I></FONT>||||reg||1
